  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">학년말에 유튜브 영상 시청하는데요.<br>영상만 시청하기에는 왠지 아쉽죠?<br>&#160;<br>그래서 챗GPT에게 문제를 만들어 달라고 했습니다.<br>&#160;<br>1. 원하는 유튜브 영상 클릭<br>2. 영상 아래 &#39;더보기&#39; 클릭</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/06871a22a268ddcfd10db0129a21ebb673578363\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/06871a22a268ddcfd10db0129a21ebb673578363\" data-origin-width=\"315\" data-origin-height=\"205\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>3. 스크립트 - 스크립트 표시&#160; 클릭</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b70779eec833c82686febbded86dab3819e0b708\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b70779eec833c82686febbded86dab3819e0b708\" data-origin-width=\"222\" data-origin-height=\"123\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>4. 화면 오른쪽에 스크립트가 나오고 전체를 블럭설정하여 복사하기</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ddefff6bed05c749192e9f4646d86bd48261cc02\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ddefff6bed05c749192e9f4646d86bd48261cc02\" data-origin-width=\"416\" data-origin-height=\"500\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>5. 복사한 스크립트를 챗GPT에 붙이기<br>&#160;<br>&#160;<br>6.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5067f202104134159972e064f8ba9dbac7f39ee8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5067f202104134159972e064f8ba9dbac7f39ee8\" data-origin-width=\"563\" data-origin-height=\"90\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">7.&#160;&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6c4eccc756adec4074a7781790c6075b21644269\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"612\" height=\"193\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6c4eccc756adec4074a7781790c6075b21644269\" data-origin-width=\"789\" data-origin-height=\"249\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">8.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/46d18069b94960e2c757a98ce549f679869dc1c5\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"583\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/46d18069b94960e2c757a98ce549f679869dc1c5\" data-origin-width=\"817\" data-origin-height=\"172\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c7211650578af31495cb1016b8bcbc49403a195d\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"551\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c7211650578af31495cb1016b8bcbc49403a195d\" data-origin-width=\"732\" data-origin-height=\"247\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>9. 이제 교사를 위한 답을 만듭니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/185b5f41a94e9f94af75e48f17072ec365bf367f\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"498\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/185b5f41a94e9f94af75e48f17072ec365bf367f\" data-origin-width=\"791\" data-origin-height=\"397\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>드디어 완성되었습니다!<br>&#160;<br>해당 영상은&#160;<br><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a2Tpe18CLq0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a2Tpe18CLq0</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a2Tpe18CLq0\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"500\" data-video-height=\"281\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/jLLJC/hyXDdIgm0k/hbv8AsX2BmLf0VvU5r5h41/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=482_72_746_360,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/gKBNQ/hyXGziBtTX/4pqVGIkmWdKyYoUgj255g1/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=482_72_746_360\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"853\" data-video-origin-height=\"480\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/a2Tpe18CLq0\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><b><span style=\"color: #f3c000;\">* 해당 50문제와 답도 공유합니다~</span></b></p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3d4995712bdbc41a7d732a2f3a9f573a6abac458?download\" data-file-name=\"동영상 50문제와 답.hwp\" data-file-size=\"60928\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DevuJ%26dataid%3D266%26fileid%3D9%26regdt%3D20241201184709&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F3d4995712bdbc41a7d732a2f3a9f573a6abac458')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">동영상 50문제와 답</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">59.50KB</div></div></a></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
